amux agent raise — raise a structured item upward (member to coordinator, else the global inbox)

usage: amux agent raise --kind <kind> --title <title> [flags]

A member's item goes to its coordinator; a coordinator's (or any session
outside a workgroup) to the global inbox. Raising the same kind and title again
while the item is still open updates it instead of adding a duplicate.

flags:
  --kind <kind>     (required) follow_up | outstanding | decision_needed | risk | fyi
  --title <text>    (required) one line
  --detail <text>   context; - reads it from stdin
  --pr <repo#n>     (repeatable) related pull request
  --link <url>      (repeatable) related link
  --suggest <text>  the next step you recommend
  --json            print the item as JSON

examples:
  amux agent raise --kind follow_up --title "flaky e2e test" --pr agent-multiplexer#12 --suggest "quarantine it"
